# apps/app's browser QA pass (qa/field.mjs): the report, screenshots and the
# throwaway JPEG fixture it writes for the capture-flow assertion all land
# here, so a QA run never dirties tracked files — CI's app-qa job asserts the
# tree is clean after one.
apps/app/qa-output/

# Vercel project link (orgId / projectId), created by `vercel link` and by the
# Vercel Git integration on first deploy. It identifies an account's project and
# has no business in the tree — infra/README-staging.md tells the operator to
# link from their own machine.
.vercel/
